       "✏️ 07.00 get up → seven o'clock; 07.40 catch the school bus → twenty to eight.",
       "✏️ 08.30 lessons start → half past eight; 17.00 do homework → five o'clock.",
       "✅ Sonuç: Doğru cümle “Pelin catches the school bus at twenty to eight.”",
